    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{XLIV} Ærest we bebeodað þætte Godes ðeowas hiora ryhtregol on ryht healdan.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">First we command that God’s servants hold their proper rule according to law.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">In the first place, we command that the servants of God heed, and duly observe, their proper 'rule.'</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Ærest we bebeodað, þæt Godes ðeowas heora ryhtregol on riht healdan.</ab>
      </div>
